 {:iteration 2 :id :h1-canonical-path
  :date "2026-09-15"
  :observation "find apply-pin-advance の hit が worktrees/kotoba-lang/kagami/... の 1 件のみ。正本 orgs/kotoba-lang/kagami/src/kagami/db.cljk が索引に無い"
  :cause "walk が symlink 側の path を返し、visited(realpath) が正本側を『訪問済み』で捨てた (readdir 順で worktrees/ が先)"
  :fix "file の path を realpath 相対にし、file 単位でも realpath で dedupe"
  :before {:hit-path "worktrees/kotoba-lang/kagami/src/kagami/db.cljk" :symbols-under-worktrees 305436}
  :after {:hit-path "orgs/kotoba-lang/kagami/src/kagami/db.cljk" :symbols-under-worktrees 0}
  :verdict :landed}

